Z||000000||rogergarrison||08-18-2001||12:07 AM||||Just got done watching tonites ASA race. My friend Gary got ripped off bad. Leading all the last 50 some laps. Got rammed into the wall on last 1/2 lap. This is second time Eddys did it. I thought Gary was gonna rip his head off, he took off in a dead run across the track to where the finish line was. Anyone who thinks the racing is fixed shoulda seen it. I thought Id be going to a party tommorrow afternoon. At least another local driver I know did win from third place. Some will say thats just racing, but the same guy plows into you twice trying to pass you when he knows your faster. Nascar should watch a few ASA races to get back on the right track. That was some great racing even though it turned out shi**y. Songman, I pull for your buddy too, I got an '88' watch. I raced Mark in ASA when he was a little spoiled brat like Gordon. Last time was at Winchester, Ind. not too far from here. ||||reg||1
Z||000001||Songman||08-18-2001||12:14 AM||||I don't know any of the names from ASA, Roger, but I love watching most kinds of racing. From NASCAR to Formula 1 to sprint cars... and I know like you do that the sponsors may be in it for the money but the drivers are still there for the thrill!<P>I've been a DJ fan for a long time. Glad I was getting to be around when he finally won his championship. I actually got to drive that rig in the picture back from St Louis to Nashville one time. It was a blast! <P>My girlfriend is a Gordon fan. I told her she was going ot have to pick another driver.. she picked Tony Stewart! Sheesh!  He drives a Pontiac but that is about all I can say for him! hehe<P>I was always a Dale Earnhardt fan too. I always believed and still do that all variables being equal there was not a driver on the track that could beat him. It's not the same without him out there.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
Z||000002||FieroKyle||08-18-2001||12:17 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Songman:<BR><B>I was always a Dale Earnhardt fan too. I always believed and still do that all variables being equal there was not a driver on the track that could beat him. It's not the same without him out there.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>same here. its not the same anymore. I was a Earnhardt fan since the mid 90's when I got watching NASCAR. nobody could drive like him.. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>||||reg||1
